  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "设计期 · 打包闭环",
      "items": [
        "ikat CLI（crates/packer/pkg）：check / build / preview / list / scaffold / design 等 12 个子命令",
        "ikat_fence schema + pipeline 打包期拒绝围栏外语法；IrTree→TemplateNode 桥在 pkg/src/bridge.rs",
        "打包入口仅是壳：ikat_gui（Tauri）与 Ikat > Open Packer 菜单只子进程调起 ikat.exe——打包语义全在 CLI"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "运行时 · Rust 核心",
      "items": [
        "ikat_core 16 模块引擎无关：Stage::instantiate 克隆模板，tick_and_render() 产出 FrameData",
        "ikat_ffi extern \"C\" 薄包装 opaque Stage；csbindgen 生成 IkatBindings.cs，产物 Plugins/Ikat/ikat_ffi_c.dll",
        "fence 单向依赖 core 复用选择器 / rule 类型，自身停在 IrTree"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Unity 消费侧",
      "items": [
        "Public/ 类型化对象树：UIPackage / UIContext / Container…Link，TweenBuilder + AnimationHandle",
        "Host/ IkatHost.Step(dt) 每帧驱动；MirrorPool 把渲染树镜像为 GameObject + MeshRenderer",
        "Projection/ NodeFactory · StyleMirror · EventBus 把语义事件路由回业务代码"
      ]
    }
  ]
